SystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达与Meta达成深度合作并投资30亿美元，共同推进Muse模型与AI智能体落地</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面发布开源旗舰大模型K3.1 Pro，支持2.8T参数与百万上下文</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI计划采购谷歌自研AI芯片以实现算力供应链多元化布局</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind发布实时交互世界模型Genie4，加速具身智能与多模态模拟演进</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f4be0b307adb96e5fb09c3aaea4e94a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind于2026年10月27日正式发布实时交互世界模型Genie4。该模型深度融合Gemini系列核心能力，利用Gemini Omni将模拟锚定于现实世界的外观与行为，并结合其他Gemini模型提供复杂推理支撑。Genie4支持用户实时操控场景，包括动态移动镜头、改变天气及引入角色，并能即时生成包含环境音效、背景音乐及互动对话的原生音频。作为具身智能的关键技术，Genie4为机器人和智能体提供安全虚拟训练环境，同时赋能电影制作、游戏开发及制造业。目前，该模型已向部分受信任测试人员开放，后续将通过Project Genie向Google AI Ultra订阅用户推出，并接入Gemini API和AI Studio，加速前沿模拟技术的商业化落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果在 iOS 27.2 系统中接入谷歌 SynthID 技术为 AI 图片添加隐身水印</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b501b3464a32109c86ef8e2889a15882.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果在 iOS 27.2 版本中正式接入谷歌 SynthID 技术，为 AI 生成内容引入像素级隐身水印。该技术通过在像素层面埋入标记，确保 AI 图片在经过裁剪、滤镜或压缩等后期处理后仍能被识别。具体应用场景包括：所有由“图乐园”生成的图片均自带水印；使用 Apple 智能中的“扩展”与“重新构图”功能编辑的照片会被标记为 AI 生成；“清理”功能则根据改动幅度动态触发水印。目前，iOS 系统尚未内置检测入口，用户需通过 SynthID Detector 网页端验证图片真伪。此举标志着手机厂商正将 AI 内容标识功能从第三方工具整合至操作系统底层，旨在应对全球对生成式 AI 内容溯源与透明度的监管要求，为行业建立 AI 内容防伪防线提供系统级参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达与Meta达成深度合作并投资30亿美元，共同推进Muse模型与AI智能体落地</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/837e8480446dc967b8c6050f597a41dd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达与Meta宣布建立深度合作伙伴关系，英伟达将向Meta股权发行投资30亿美元，双方将全面扩大在Muse系列模型上的技术合作，以提升推理与训练性能。在技术协同方面，Meta将依托英伟达OpenShell参考架构强化AI智能体安全体系，并利用英伟达Sentry实现跨结构化、非结构化及图数据场景的智能体行为全链路监控。硬件部署上，Meta将扩大部署英伟达Vera Rubin系统、Spectrum-X以太网网络及BlueField-4，以赋能底层AI工作负载的性能与扩展上限。此次合作旨在加速AI智能体从技术验证向工业级实用落地转型，通过算力基础设施与大模型技术的深度绑定，重塑下一代人工智能基础设施的竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面发布开源旗舰大模型K3.1 Pro，支持2.8T参数与百万上下文</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面正式发布开源旗舰大模型K3.1 Pro，该模型参数规模达2.8T，并支持1M Token超长上下文处理。官方确认，K3.1 Pro完整模型权重将于11月4日前全面开源，目前已上线OpenRouter供开发者调用测试。在Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index评测中，该模型以55分位列榜单第四。API定价方面，标准版输入价格为13元/百万Token，输出价格为68元/百万Token，成本较K3版本降低约50%。此外，官方同步推出Highspeed版本，针对高频实时交互场景，输出速度提升至标准版的2至3倍，定价相应翻倍。此次发布旨在通过高性能与灵活的定价策略，满足开发者在不同应用场景下的差异化需求，进一步推动国产大模型生态建设。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI计划采购谷歌自研AI芯片以实现算力供应链多元化布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1e6ad108dfe19e2bc936f10c1c970f7d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正计划采购谷歌自研的人工智能芯片，旨在打破对单一算力供应商的依赖，加速构建多元化的硬件供应链体系。目前，该潜在交易的具体财务条款、采购规模及合作细节尚未对外披露。作为大模型领域的头部企业，OpenAI此前在算力基础设施上高度依赖传统芯片巨头与云服务商。此次采购计划不仅标志着OpenAI在底层硬件策略上的重大调整，也反映了当前科技巨头在AI算力领域呈现出竞争与合作并存的复杂态势。对于行业而言，此举可能重塑AI芯片市场的竞争格局，并推动算力资源配置向更加开放和多元的方向发展。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
